-Ray marching dithering techniques are documented in various rendering contexts. The UV perturbation method is implemented in the `WebGL-RayMarch` repository [S1, unofficial]. Blue noise dithering for cloudscapes was discussed in blog posts on real-time volumetric rendering [S2, unofficial]. Step jittering was employed in academic projects for rendering underwater scenes and participating media [S3, unofficial].
